ing  footage of this thing pre-patch makes me  queasy so i'll take your word for it  the a.s val you already know where i'm  going with this  when this thing launched with season six  it was an unassuming assault rifle that  had a built-in suppressor  it had a fast time to kill a small  magazine size and worked really well at  short range  however at level 42 you unlocked the  9x39 ammo conversion  that broke warzone in half while the  description calls for a higher bullet  penetration  this was able to shoot through any  structure you can think of and not just  a single barrier either  players were wall banging their shots  and using the snapshot grenade to find  anyone and everyone it took zero effort  to rack up kills  and the only thing that could stop you  in the final circle was another player  doing the exact same thing  funny enough the other gun released  alongside the as val was the spr208  which was also busted  both of these guns got their patches but  the impact had been made  these guns were definitely broken  next we have infinite warfare's proteus  in the days of summer event that took  place in june of 2017  we were gifted three free guns and one  of them was the proteus  sniper shotgun hybrid while it sounded  kind of strange it didn't matter because  on launch day this gun was a hot mess  it had a game breaking bug where when  hip fired your shot would land on the  nearest opponent  that's right the proteus had a built-in  aimbot  what's worse is that it was a one-shot  kill the proteus was patched within 24  hours  but as you can see here people had loads  of fun and captured their memories  online for us to enjoy  by the way even after the patch this  thing is still supposedly pretty damn  nasty  did you get your hands on the broken  proteus for the day let me know in the  comments  next up is the fennec but probably not  the one you're thinking of  we're talking call of duty mobile i  booted up the game and gave it a try  and yeah this shouldn't be allowed i  didn't even need to dual wield them to  see what you guys meant  one fennec alone just rips through  everyone this footage is recorded using  the desktop app  but trust me when i say i had the same  experience on my actual phone  [Music]  black ops 3's 205 brecci shotgun  from the comments section of our part 1  video this was by far the most highly  requested gun  we've previously discussed the brecci on  our channel so i figured you guys didn't  want to hear about it  and i was wrong this semi-auto shotgun  killed faster than almost any other  weapon in the game  two shots from the hip was all it took  this gun also fell  victim to the jitter mod this would  glitch your firing animation and spam  your shots faster than you intended  even after that was patched out players  flocked to the brexit for its fast time  to kill and spammy qualities  again on paper it wasn't supposed to be  the best shotgun but here we are still  talking about it  it was so smooth and deadly to the point  of annoyance  you can just pick up your controller and  wail on children who don't obey the esrb  ratings  bottom line people love the brecci and  love to hate it  but i think we can all agree it was  broken  remember if you don't see the broken gun  you were thinking of on this list  check out part one here thanks for  watching and i'll see you next time  [Music]  you

